## ATURAN OTOMATIS PASCA-EKSEKUSI / AUTOMATIC POST-EXECUTION HOOK (NON-NEGOTIABLE)
Setiap kali kamu SELESAI melakukan edit kode, perbaikan bug, atau penyempurnaan visual:
After completing ANY code edit, bug fix, refactor, or visual refinement:

1. WAJIB append prompt dan ringkasan pekerjaan ke PROMPT_LOG.md dengan header Log # berurutan.
   ALWAYS append an entry to PROMPT_LOG.md with incremental Log # header.
   - Increment Log # sequentially.
   - Include: timestamp, purpose, changed files (markdown links), Status line.
   - Format:
       ## Log #N: Short Title
       - **Timestamp:** YYYY-MM-DD
       - **Tujuan:** one-sentence purpose
       ### Rincian Perubahan:
       1. **ComponentName** (file:///abs/path): what changed and why.
       ### Status:
       Done. vitest 32/32 green · tsc 0 errors.

2. WAJIB append analisis akar masalah, keputusan arsitektur, dan penjelasan teknis ke BUG_EXPLANATION_LOCAL.md.
   ALWAYS append a section to BUG_EXPLANATION_LOCAL.md
   - Title: ## <Topic> (Log #N)
   - Include root-cause analysis, architecture decision, gotchas.

3. JANGAN PERNAH menyelesaikan turn tanpa memverifikasi KEDUA file sudah di-update.
   NEVER finish a turn without verifying BOTH documentation files are updated.

4. Pertahankan seluruh test suite tetap hijau dan tsc bersih.
   ALWAYS verify before ending the turn:
   - bunx vitest run → 32/32 passed (never regress)
   - tsc across all workspaces → 0 errors
   - Mobile 390px viewport — no horizontal overflow

## ANTI-SLOP DESIGN RULES (enforced on every UI change)
- NO floating badge capsules above headings
- NO three-column symmetrical feature boxes with green checkmarks
- NO purple-prose marketing copy ("revolutionary", "seamless", "turnkey")
- NO font sizes that overflow at 390px viewport
- NO Indonesian/mixed-language copy in UI components — 100% professional English
- YES Airbnb / Linear minimalist aesthetic
- YES Rausch gradient for primary CTA: from-[#E61E4D] via-[#E31C5F] to-[#D70466]
- YES Airbnb canonical auth: input container with focus-within ring, label inside top

## AUTH PATTERN (Airbnb Canonical)
- Single unified identifier field (email or phone) → detects type → routes to password/OTP step
- Primary button: h-12 rounded-xl Rausch gradient text-white font-semibold text-sm tracking-wide
- Social buttons: h-12 rounded-xl border border-border/80, icon absolute left-4, text w-full text-center text-sm font-medium
- Legal footer: text-xs text-muted-foreground/80, clickable ToS and Privacy Policy links with toast

